{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42118","headline":"宿蒋帝庙明日游山南诸寺 · 徐铉","name":"宿蒋帝庙明日游山南诸寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"便返城闉尚未甘，更从山北到山南。\n花枝似雪春虽半，桂魄如眉日始三。\n松盖遮门寒黯黯，柳丝妨路翠𣯶?\n登临莫怪偏留恋，游宦多年事事谙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}